sentences.text:
The petitioner/accused is hereby enlarged on bail on the following conditions:
i) That he shall not abscond or threaten the witnesses;
ii) That he shall appear before the Court as and when required;
iii) That he shall not leave the jurisdiction of the State, and if so required, due permission has to be applied before the Trial Court;
iv) That he shall execute a personal bond of  50,000/-
(Rupees fifty thousand) only with two sureties of like amount.
8.

opennyai_summary.decision:
Under the circumstances, this petition is allowed.
The petitioner/accused is hereby enlarged on bail on the following conditions:
i) That he shall not abscond or threaten the witnesses;
ii) That he shall appear before the Court as and when required;
iii) That he shall not leave the jurisdiction of the State, and if so required, due permission has to be applied before the Trial Court;
iv) That he shall execute a personal bond of  50,000/-
(Rupees fifty thousand) only with two sureties of like amount.
8.
As indicated above, violation of any of these conditions would render the bail liable to be cancelled.
9. Bail application stands disposed of.

